==Description==
The '''Lemons Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 10 of the regular [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|280}} or {{Robux|50}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|1,430}} or {{Robux|635}}.

The '''Lemons Nametag''' has light yellow text with a darker yellow outline. Yellow lemons and sparkles emit from the text. A yellow water splash-like texture continuously falls behind the text.

